       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPOUND.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BAL  PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
       01 YR   PIC 99.
       01 OUT  PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING YR FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL YR > 5
               COMPUTE BAL ROUNDED = BAL * 1.05
               MOVE BAL TO OUT
               DISPLAY "YEAR " YR ": " OUT
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
